 "2117713310619468079", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 10119, "like_count": 405, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 42}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117699008403738819", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "If you think the other party is murderous commies and Islamists, then it is SUPER SUPER IMPORTANT that your own party be at its absolute BEST, since losing means you are now governed by commies and Islamists.\n\nInstead people use commies and Islamists as excuses for the GOP https://t.co/Z0wdkqfO4a", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117713310619468079"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:31:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117655833463214411"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/alanmcole/stat…", "end": 200, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/alanmcole/status/2117655595474141310", "start": 177, "url": "https://t.co/JN2KHvdGf0"}]}, "id": "2117655833463214411", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2991, "like_count": 68, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117655595474141310", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Exactly.\n\nThere is no presumption that students can just bring any random thing they want to school! Schools are and should be constrained, regulated environments for learning! https://t.co/JN2KHvdGf0", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117655833463214411"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:21:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117653509164380581"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/tracewoodgrain…", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/tracewoodgrains/status/2117588026872479895", "start": 220, "url": "https://t.co/HGT4hKvtWv"}]}, "id": "2117653509164380581", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 7359, "like_count": 73, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 6}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117588026872479895", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "If we could edit embryos non-destructively I would personally not feel that I had any grievous moral grounds to critique.\n\nI would still have some broader cultural effect concerns, but I would not see it as active evil. https://t.co/HGT4hKvtWv", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117653509164380581"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:19:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117653006678372859"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/danagoldstein/…", "end": 30, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/danagoldstein/status/2117626482738487573", "start": 7, "url": "https://t.co/IxOOrjzYyS"}]}, "id": "2117653006678372859", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 7143, "like_count": 126, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 8}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117626482738487573", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Insane https://t.co/IxOOrjzYyS", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117653006678372859"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:18:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117652715345957153"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jakozloski/sta…", "end": 146, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jakozloski/status/2117632907481162160", "start": 123, "url": "https://t.co/HkY7mq904H"}]}, "id": "2117652715345957153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 23, "impression_count": 11994, "like_count": 278, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 7}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117632907481162160", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I would actually argue the modern person has probably evaluated FEWER relationship candidates than their grandparents did! https://t.co/HkY7mq904H", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117652715345957153"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T16:17:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117652427566662112"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jenniferdoleac…",