": "quoted"}], "text": "What if China’s invasion plan is to frogboil an amphibious assault https://t.co/VpV7Lkv0PV", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117650779708240355"}, {"author_id": "11348282", "created_at": "2026-11-03T15:00:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117633046002225363"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 86, "id": "29472803", "start": 77, "username": "NASAWebb"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/w3Tv1m9Fuf", "end": 231, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2117633046002225363/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117633042281836544", "start": 208, "url": "https://t.co/w3Tv1m9Fuf"}]}, "id": "2117633046002225363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 302, "impression_count": 1134528, "like_count": 5253, "quote_count": 82, "reply_count": 296, "retweet_count": 702}, "text": "This smoky specter is the Cat’s Head Nebula, captured in intricate detail by @NASAWebb. Its name comes from its shape, which resembles a cosmic kitty sitting with its back toward the viewer. What do you see? https://t.co/w3Tv1m9Fuf", "url": "https://x.com/NASA/status/2117633046002225363"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:06:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117619483288523255"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/MattPrinciple/…", "end": 165, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/MattPrinciple/status/2117615817697509392", "start": 142, "url": "https://t.co/CZUTYFpLuW"}]}, "id": "2117619483288523255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2414, "like_count": 40, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 2}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117615817697509392", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Uh, no.\n\nIt's not that *females* develop these relationships.\n\nJapanese and Korean men develop parasocial relationships with celebrities too! https://t.co/CZUTYFpLuW", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117619483288523255"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T14:05:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117619150218465374"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/lymanstoneky/s…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117597904919519247", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/bIz1OwL3fJ"}]}, "id": "2117619150218465374", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 21, "impression_count": 11605, "like_count": 319, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117597904919519247", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I'm aware me saying this sort of thing in public wins me zero friends in the admin, but somebody has got to call balls and strikes, and it can't be left to libs who just think family life is backwards and out of date anyways.\n\nThis administration has been a colossal failure on https://t.co/bIz1OwL3fJ", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117619150218465374"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T13:27:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117609532574540271"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/jayinkyiv/stat…", "end": 32, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/jayinkyiv/status/2117559416228552825", "start": 9, "url": "https://t.co/sgAAr83Ta2"}]}, "id": "2117609532574540271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2021, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117559416228552825", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Ah, well https://t.co/sgAAr83Ta2", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117609532574540271"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:40:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117597904919519247"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/furkangozukara…", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/furkangozukara/status/2117214422020375019", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/eGy7lZbBMQ"}]}, "id": "2117597904919519247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 43450, "like_count": 721, "quote_count": 6, "re