ibilities\n\nBut as a diehard “incentives matter and wages should approximate productivity” guy, this *particular* finding strongly matches my priors https://t.co/rQS1jylgGK", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117592479306281096"}, {"author_id": "626660983", "created_at": "2026-11-03T12:11:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117590428258336835"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 129, "id": "1887207443257528320", "start": 120, "username": "PeterRFB"}], "urls": [{"description": "Visible engagement with family life by cultural leaders matters for fertility.", "display_url": "ifstudies.org/blog/celebrity…", "end": 222, "expanded_url": "https://ifstudies.org/blog/celebrity-culture-predicted-fertility-decline-in-japan-and-south-korea", "images": [{"height": 500, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117580938343555072/qijDu_Ct?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1000}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117580938343555072/qijDu_Ct?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 199, "status": 200, "title": "Celebrity Culture Predicted Fertility Decline in Japan and South Korea", "unwound_url": "https://ifstudies.org/blog/celebrity-culture-predicted-fertility-decline-in-japan-and-south-korea", "url": "https://t.co/9Ac8vHCnVc"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/16LIPWwoDE", "end": 246, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117590428258336835/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2117590423375855617", "start": 223, "url": "https://t.co/16LIPWwoDE"}]}, "id": "2117590428258336835", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 118, "impression_count": 19007, "like_count": 181, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 19}, "text": "Why did Japan’s fertility have an unusual decline in the 1980s?\n\nWhy did South Korea suddenly drop in the early 1990s?\n\n@PeterRFB suggests a possible explanation, and the kids are not gonna like it.\nhttps://t.co/9Ac8vHCnVc https://t.co/16LIPWwoDE", "url": "https://x.com/lymanstoneky/status/2117590428258336835"}